| Capability | State | Evidence |
|---|---|---|
| Marketing experience | Current | Astro source and build |
| Contact notification | Current | Cloudflare Worker source |
| Markdoc source of truth | Current | Content collection and docs routes |
| Natural-language translation | Simulated/local | Unit tests and workspace |
| Markdoc retrieval | Simulated/local | Reader, index, retriever tests |
| Claude/Codex routing | Simulated/local | Policy and fallback tests |
| Deterministic context/prompt compilation | Current/local | Reference-first inventory, hashes, dedupe, budget, and exact-data tests |
| Agent role contract validation | Current/local | Fixed manifest, source SHA bindings, schema validator and tests |
| Run/token telemetry foundation | Current/local | AgentRun/ProviderRun schemas, normalizers, redaction and append-only sink tests |
| Agent eval harness | Current/local | Sixteen scenario families, deterministic result schema, live lane separated |
| Deterministic tool policy | Current/local | Role/path/action gateway, Claude hook, and bypass tests |
| Provider adapters | Current/credential-gated | Claude/OpenAI HTTP and read-only ephemeral Codex CLI contracts; no successful live record yet |
| Risk-tiered council | Current/local | Risk 0–3, isolated lanes, cross-provider and blocker/adjudication tests |
| Evidence-gated tuning | Current/local | Frozen baseline and no-regression candidate gate; live baseline absent |
| Agent publication CI | Current/local | Diff hash, author/QA/review/check/authority evidence policy and workflow |
| Release provenance and rollback | Current definitions | Signed-attestation, same-artifact, verification, and rollback workflows; no real drill yet |
| Automatic real-run telemetry | Pending evidence | One attempted Codex smoke timed out without records; controlled live run still required |
| Durable queue/audit | Proposed | In-memory interfaces only |
| Isolated worktrees | Proposed | Policy documented; no executor |
| Merge/deploy/release | External human-controlled | Workflow definitions exist; environment approval and real promotion evidence remain incomplete |
